featured_reviews.review_text:
"Goodluck Café — Bandra's timeless classic has been my childhood haunt for Kheema-Kulcha, Haleem, and Bun Maska-Chai for as long as I can remember. It’s still one of the few places where you can get that authentic, old-school taste. Just a note — the Kheema here is traditionally made with b**f, so if you prefer a different meat, make sure to specify when ordering. They have Seekh Kababs and other good selections off their menu too but my personal favourites will always be the Kheema, Haleem, and that comforting Bun Maska-Chai. Their Chicken Berry Pulao is an absolutely amazing and is a special they only serve over the weekends."☕️🥙

